# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IMPORTANT: the folders below are NOT ignored — they MUST be pushed to GitHub
# so that media uploads, backups and reference assets travel with the repo.
#
#   uploads/         (admin-uploaded images / videos / pdfs)
#   data/backups/    (DB + file backups created from /admin/backups)
#   attached_assets/ (reference docs and original assets)
#   public/          (static assets served at /)
#   src/assets/      (bundled product/hero images)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
